  "description": "Syncfusion® A2UI Core Library is a framework-agnostic .NET port of the A2UI v0.9 protocol (originally @a2ui/web_core by Google LLC). It provides message processing, state management, data binding, catalog, schema validation, reactivity and serialization without any UI framework dependency, enabling integration with Blazor, MAUI, WPF, WinForms and ASP.NET Core renderers. Compatible with .NET 8, .NET 9, .NET 10, and .NET 11.",
